from (values
('127.611.d.4.E',4,'A growing demand for quality child care is a future trend in the field of early childhood:','["debt", "mining", "aviation", "education"]'::jsonb,3,'More families need child care.','original'),
('127.611.d.4.F',3,'Opening a home-based child care business is an example of an:','["entrepreneurial opportunity", "insurance claim", "product warranty", "tax refund"]'::jsonb,0,'Entrepreneurs create jobs for themselves.','original'),
('127.611.d.4.F',4,'To work in a child care center, a person often needs training in first aid, CPR, and:','["stock trading", "child development", "welding", "engine repair"]'::jsonb,1,'Preparation matches the job.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.A',3,'Providing love, protection, and a place to learn values are basic functions of the:','["theater", "stadium", "family", "mall"]'::jsonb,2,'Families meet members'' needs.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.A',4,'In a household, sharing chores and caring for younger siblings are examples of family:','["tasks to avoid", "vacations", "rivalries", "roles and responsibilities"]'::jsonb,3,'Members take on different duties.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.B',3,'A job loss, a move to a new country, or a rising cost of living are factors that can affect the:','["family", "stock", "weather", "calendar"]'::jsonb,0,'Social and economic forces shape family life.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.B',4,'Changes in the average size and age of households are examples of what kind of factor affecting families?','["musical", "demographic", "athletic", "culinary"]'::jsonb,1,'Demographics describe population characteristics.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.C',3,'A person who is a parent, an employee, and a volunteer is assuming multiple:','["costumes", "debts", "roles", "holidays"]'::jsonb,2,'People hold several roles at once.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.C',4,'Balancing work and family duties can be hard because each role has its own:','["colors", "vacations", "rewards only", "responsibilities"]'::jsonb,3,'Roles can compete for time.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.D',3,'Serving meals at a food bank is a community service opportunity that helps:','["people in need", "stores", "banks only", "no one"]'::jsonb,0,'Service benefits the community.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.D',4,'Volunteering at a local shelter or tutoring younger students are ways to practice:','["competition", "community service", "tardiness", "isolation"]'::jsonb,1,'Service builds skills and helps others.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.E',3,'Teenagers, adults, and older adults need different calories and nutrients because dietary needs change across the:','["week", "season", "life span", "weather"]'::jsonb,2,'Nutrition needs vary by age.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.E',4,'An older adult may need more calcium and fewer calories than a growing teen. This shows how dietary practices differ across the:','["menu", "budget", "map", "life span"]'::jsonb,3,'Needs change as people age.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.F',3,'Eating a balanced diet with enough protein and vitamins supports healthy growth and:','["wellness", "fatigue", "weakness", "illness"]'::jsonb,0,'Good nutrition supports the body.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.F',4,'Skipping meals regularly can reduce energy and lower:','["growth charts", "productivity", "rest", "hunger"]'::jsonb,1,'Nutrition affects performance.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.G',3,'A snack of apple slices with peanut butter provides fiber, protein, and healthy fat to support:','["fatigue", "cravings", "wellness and energy", "illness"]'::jsonb,2,'Balanced snacks fuel the body.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.G',4,'Which snack combines nutrients best for steady energy?','["candy", "soda", "chips alone", "whole-grain crackers with cheese"]'::jsonb,3,'Carbohydrates plus protein last longer.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.H',3,'Social workers and community outreach workers are careers in family and community:','["services", "farming", "trade", "sports"]'::jsonb,0,'These careers support families.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.H',4,'A rewarding part of a social services career is helping families, but a demand is often heavy:','["vacations", "caseloads", "salaries", "holidays"]'::jsonb,1,'Caseloads can be very high.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.I',3,'A person who starts a nonprofit to help families find housing is pursuing an:','["product label", "tax break", "entrepreneurial opportunity", "employee benefit"]'::jsonb,2,'Entrepreneurs can serve communities.','original'),
('127.611.d.5.I',4,'Preparing for a social services career usually requires education in social work, human services, or:','["aviation", "mining", "welding", "counseling"]'::jsonb,3,'Related education helps.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.A',3,'Climate, activity, cost, and personal style are factors that influence a person''s choice of:','["apparel", "school", "hobby", "address"]'::jsonb,0,'Many things affect what people wear.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.A',4,'A job that requires a uniform and a limited budget are factors influencing apparel:','["design", "selection", "history", "disposal"]'::jsonb,1,'Needs and cost guide clothing choices.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.B',3,'A person who uses a wheelchair may choose clothing with adaptive features such as magnetic closures. This shows that apparel selection should accommodate:','["fashion trends only", "price tags", "personal needs", "store sales"]'::jsonb,2,'Clothing should fit the wearer''s needs.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.B',4,'Choosing loose, easy-to-fasten clothing for someone with arthritis is an apparel practice that accommodates a person''s:','["social media", "schedule", "mood", "physical needs"]'::jsonb,3,'Selection should consider ability.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.C',3,'A care label with a washtub symbol and a number tells you the maximum:','["wash temperature", "price", "fiber source", "size"]'::jsonb,0,'Labels tell how to wash and dry.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.C',4,'A care label that says ''dry clean only'' means you should not:','["wear it", "wash it in a home machine", "fold it", "buy it"]'::jsonb,1,'Following the label prevents damage.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.D',3,'Keeping scissors sharp and storing pins in a pincushion are safety practices for apparel:','["disposal", "marketing", "construction tools", "shopping"]'::jsonb,2,'Tool safety prevents injury.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.D',4,'When using a sewing machine, you should keep your fingers away from the:','["fabric hem", "bobbin cover", "spool pin", "needle"]'::jsonb,3,'The moving needle can cause injury.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.E',3,'Sewing on a button or fixing a seam are examples of simple clothing:','["repair techniques", "marketing plans", "lines", "dye methods"]'::jsonb,0,'Basic repairs extend clothing life.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.E',4,'Taking in a waistband so pants fit better is a clothing:','["purchase", "alteration", "donation", "disposal"]'::jsonb,1,'Alterations change the fit of a garment.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.F',3,'A fashion designer enjoys creative work, but a demand of the job can be tight:','["salaries", "buildings", "deadlines", "vacations"]'::jsonb,2,'Design careers have pressure.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.F',4,'A future trend in fashion design is the use of recycled and sustainable:','["typewriters", "coins", "maps", "fabrics"]'::jsonb,3,'Sustainability is growing in fashion.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.G',3,'A person who runs a custom alterations shop is pursuing an:','["entrepreneurial opportunity", "warranty claim", "tax refund", "employee benefit"]'::jsonb,0,'Entrepreneurs own their business.','original'),
('127.611.d.6.G',4,'Preparation for a fashion design career often includes sewing skills, design education, and building a:','["stockpile", "portfolio", "pension", "payroll"]'::jsonb,1,'Portfolios show design work.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.A',3,'A family that needs lots of storage and a low budget should consider those priorities when making interior:','["travel plans", "diet choices", "design decisions", "school rules"]'::jsonb,2,'Needs and priorities guide interior choices.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.A',4,'A person who works from home requires a quiet space, which would influence where a desk is placed. Such a requirement is a(n) interior design:','["penalty", "error", "tax", "need"]'::jsonb,3,'Needs shape design.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.B',3,'Line, shape, color, and texture are elements of design, while balance and rhythm are:','["principles of design", "safety rules", "cooking steps", "tax forms"]'::jsonb,0,'Elements are the parts; principles guide their use.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.B',4,'In a room, repeating a color in pillows, a rug, and curtains creates:','["noise", "rhythm", "clutter", "glare"]'::jsonb,1,'Repetition creates visual flow.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.C',3,'Reading and following the manufacturer''s directions helps people use and care for furniture and appliances:','["never", "rarely", "safely", "quickly"]'::jsonb,2,'Directions explain proper use.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.C',4,'Overloading an extension cord is unsafe because it can cause a:','["clean floor", "sale", "coupon", "fire"]'::jsonb,3,'Equipment should be used within its limits.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.D',3,'Keeping walkways clear and fixing loose rugs are maintenance practices that prevent:','["falls", "sales", "comfort", "growth"]'::jsonb,0,'Safe interiors reduce injury.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.D',4,'Installing smoke detectors and checking their batteries are practices that make interiors:','["darker", "safer", "louder", "colder"]'::jsonb,1,'Maintenance protects occupants.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.E',3,'Family traditions, population changes, and the cost of housing can all influence the design of:','["sports", "highways", "interiors", "recipes"]'::jsonb,2,'Culture and economics shape interiors.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.E',4,'A family from a culture that removes shoes at the door may add a bench and shoe storage. This shows how culture influences:','["business law", "cooking", "transportation", "interior design"]'::jsonb,3,'Customs shape spaces.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.F',3,'Interior designers enjoy creating spaces, but they must also meet client:','["budgets", "pets", "birthdays", "vacations"]'::jsonb,0,'Designers work within client limits.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.F',4,'A future trend in interior design is the growing interest in energy-efficient and eco-friendly:','["typewriters", "materials", "coins", "maps"]'::jsonb,1,'Sustainability influences design.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.G',3,'A designer who opens a home staging company is pursuing an:','["warranty claim", "tax refund", "entrepreneurial opportunity", "employee benefit"]'::jsonb,2,'Entrepreneurs start businesses.','original'),
('127.611.d.7.G',4,'Careers in interior design often require training in design principles, drawing, and:','["mining", "welding", "aviation", "client communication"]'::jsonb,3,'Preparation includes technical and people skills.','original'),
('127.611.d.8.A',3,'Online appointment apps and new styling tools are examples of emerging technologies that may affect personal care:','["services", "debts", "seasons", "buildings"]'::jsonb,0,'Technology changes how services are delivered.','original'),
