('127.611.d.8.A',4,'A salon that offers online booking and text reminders is using technology to improve:','["hours of sleep", "inventory only", "taxes", "customer service"]'::jsonb,3,'Tech makes services easier for clients.','original'),
('127.611.d.8.C',3,'A stylist who records a client''s color formula and preferences can quickly retrieve that:','["personal data", "weather", "rumor", "menu"]'::jsonb,0,'Records help repeat services.','original'),
('127.611.d.8.C',4,'Keeping client records private and secure follows both ethical practice and:','["fashion", "privacy laws", "advertising", "gossip"]'::jsonb,1,'Client data must be protected.','original')
