('127.611.d.8.E',3,'Personal care careers can be rewarding because workers help people feel good, but demands can include long hours standing and dealing with:','["chemicals and demanding clients", "few skills needed", "no clients", "no work"]'::jsonb,0,'Careers carry both rewards and demands.','original'),
