('127.612.d.2.A',3,'Sanitizing tools after every client is a health and safety procedure that prevents the spread of:','["infection", "music", "clients", "conversation"]'::jsonb,0,'Disinfecting protects clients.','original'),
('127.612.d.2.A',4,'A cosmetologist should wash hands before and after each:','["hour", "client service", "lunch break", "phone call"]'::jsonb,1,'Hand hygiene reduces germs.','original'),
