('127.612.d.2.B',4,'Spilled chemicals and electrical cords across the floor are salon hazards that can cause:','["color", "sales", "profit", "accidents"]'::jsonb,3,'Hazards should be removed promptly.','original'),
('127.612.d.2.C',3,'A cosmetology student can check exam eligibility, results, and student hours on the:','["state agency website", "fashion blog", "social feed", "salon menu"]'::jsonb,0,'Official sites hold exam and hour records.','original'),
