('127.612.d.2.D',4,'Continuing to practice with an expired license can result in:','["raises", "bonuses", "awards", "penalties"]'::jsonb,3,'Staying licensed is required.','original'),
('127.612.d.3.A',3,'Photos of a stylist''s finished color and cut work can be gathered in a digital:','["portfolio", "invoice", "menu", "coupon"]'::jsonb,0,'Portfolios show skills.','original'),
('127.612.d.3.A',4,'Adding photos of design elements such as lines and color blends to a portfolio shows employers your:','["moods", "skills", "debts", "errors"]'::jsonb,1,'Examples demonstrate ability.','original'),
('127.612.d.3.B',3,'An adjustable salon chair and a comfortable stool are ergonomically designed equipment that reduce:','["client visits", "wait times", "strain on the body", "sales"]'::jsonb,2,'Ergonomics protects workers.','original'),
('127.612.d.3.B',4,'Standing for long hours can be eased with anti-fatigue mats, which promote professional:','["rivalry", "fatigue", "delay", "efficiency"]'::jsonb,3,'Comfort supports productivity.','original'),
('127.612.d.3.C',3,'Online booking software and digital client files are technology sources used in a professional:','["salon", "farm", "bank", "factory"]'::jsonb,0,'Technology helps salons run smoothly.','original'),
('127.612.d.3.C',4,'A salon that uses text reminders for appointments is using technology to reduce:','["cleaning", "no-shows", "pricing", "styling"]'::jsonb,1,'Reminders help clients remember.','original'),
('127.612.d.3.D',3,'Used razors and needles must be placed in a special container, following universal precautions for hazardous materials and:','["combs", "capes", "sharps", "towels"]'::jsonb,2,'Sharps disposal prevents injury.','original'),
('127.612.d.3.D',4,'Universal precautions treat all blood and body fluids as potentially:','["useful", "sweet", "colorful", "infectious"]'::jsonb,3,'Treating all as infectious protects workers.','original'),
('127.612.d.4.A',3,'A stylist who asks questions about the client''s lifestyle and preferences before a service is conducting a client:','["consultation", "audit", "inspection", "invoice"]'::jsonb,0,'Consultations guide the service.','original'),
('127.612.d.4.A',4,'During a consultation, a stylist should listen to the client''s concerns and offer:','["unrelated advice", "realistic recommendations", "random guesses", "long stories"]'::jsonb,1,'Good guidance meets goals.','original'),
