('127.613.d.1.B',4,'A family that schedules grocery trips, bill due dates, and chores on a shared calendar is applying:','["luck", "management skills", "debt", "impulse"]'::jsonb,1,'Management organizes tasks and resources.','original'),
('127.613.d.1.C',3,'A shopper who researches products, compares prices, and sets a spending limit is using strategies to make wise:','["debts", "mistakes", "choices", "trades"]'::jsonb,2,'Planning supports good decisions.','original'),
