('127.613.d.5.B',3,'Property tax, income tax, and a tax added at checkout are collected at different levels of government. A tax collected by the state or city on purchases is a:','["sales tax", "property tax", "income tax", "estate tax"]'::jsonb,0,'Sales tax is added at purchase.','original'),
